@LHPets_HostAddress = http://localhost:5053

### 1. Testar listar clientes (GET)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Cadastrar um novo cliente (POST)
POST {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-00",
  "email": "maria@email.com"
}
### 3. Testar listar pets (GET)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### 4. Cadastrar um novo pet (POST)
POST {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Rex",
  "raca": "Labrador",
  "clienteId": 1
}
### 5. Consultar cliente por ID existente (ID 1)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Consultar cliente por ID inexistente (ID 99)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/99
Accept: application/json

### 7. Consultar pet por ID existente (ID 1 - Rex)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/pets/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Consultar pet por ID inexistente (ID 99)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/pets/99
Accept: application/json

### 9. Listar pets pertencentes a um cliente específico (Ex: Cliente ID 1)
GET {{LHPets_HostAddress}}/api/pets/cliente/1
Accept: application/json